Its the year 2013, right wing goverment of Peter Nečas fell because of his corruption scandal, you, ČSSD, the Czech Party of Social Democracy, are having to decide what to do next, there is a vast array of far right populist parties on the rise ,
the newly elected president Zeman is scheming in the background, and your party is plagued by infighting between rivaling factions.
What will you do?


